==Strategy==
Tankier units, especially ones like [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Rocker Cat]] due to the [[Angel Enemies]], are helpful against the Master A. You'll want to build up an insane amount of Area Attackers like [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]] and [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cats]] priot to summoning the boss, then leverage them to bulldoze the opening enemies. Piercing attackers like [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Sexy Legs Cat]] and [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Nerd Cat]] will help gradually chip down Master A.

